			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"沃莉斯菈娃"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761060201,
					"content": "…嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761060202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761060202,
					"content": "我可是为你好。没事别到设计局里边去，尤其是二层！要是吸收了太多月矩力…轻则头疼重则呕吐。别怪我没提醒过你！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "沃莉斯菈娃"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7610603,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": []
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"沃莉斯菈娃"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761060301,
					"content": "真的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761060302
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761060302,
					"content": "那当然！但凡在里面干活的家伙都会多发一杯苹果酿。你想想，要是对身体没有伤害，怎么会有这样的好事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761060303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沃莉斯菈娃"
				},
				{
					"id": 761060303,
					"content": "再说了，我之前在霜月之子那边亲眼所见！他们的那些执祭头上都长出角来了，你说这能正常吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761060304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沃莉斯菈娃"
				},
				{
					"id": 761060304,
					"content": "原来是这样…多谢提醒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761060305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761060305,
					"content": "听上去好可怕哦！会、会变成怪物吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761060306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761060306,
					"content": "唉，尽派新来的做这些危险的事…你自己小心些吧，别在里面待太久。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "沃莉斯菈娃"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7610604,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7610601
